Software included in the app binary
------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Rust dependencies (about 700 crates) are under permissive licenses:
mostly MIT and/or Apache-2.0, plus Zlib, ISC, BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause,
Unicode-3.0, Unlicense, CC0-1.0, 0BSD, BSL-1.0 and CDLA-Permissive-2.0
(webpki-roots). A few crates used by Tauri's HTML tooling are under
MPL-2.0 (cssparser, cssparser-macros, selectors, dtoa-short, option-ext);
their source is available unchanged from crates.io. To list every crate and
its license: `cargo metadata --format-version 1` or `cargo about`.

Main components:
  Tauri 2 (tauri, tauri-build, tauri-nspanel)   MIT OR Apache-2.0
  rmcp (Model Context Protocol SDK)             Apache-2.0
  transcribe-rs                                 MIT
  ptts                                          MIT OR Apache-2.0
  ort (ONNX Runtime bindings)                   MIT OR Apache-2.0
  ONNX Runtime (Microsoft, static via ort)      MIT
  portable-pty                                  MIT
  cpal                                          Apache-2.0
  hound                                         Apache-2.0
  axum, tokio                                   MIT
  objc2 family                                  MIT
  image, reqwest, ureq, serde, sha2             MIT OR Apache-2.0

Frontend (bundled into the app):
  Svelte                                        MIT
  @tauri-apps/api                               Apache-2.0 OR MIT

